# 14. S-DES BACKEND

Implement REAL Simplified DES.

Support:

* 10-bit key
* P10
* P8
* P4
* IP
* IP inverse
* EP
* S0
* S1
* SW
* FK
* K1
* K2
* Encryption
* Decryption

Support both:

### Binary Mode

8-bit blocks.

### Text Mode

Convert characters into 8-bit ASCII blocks.

Return intermediate values for educational visualization.

