# 15. STEGANOGRAPHY BACKEND

Implement LSB image steganography.

Use PNG as the preferred format.

Process:

```text
Image
↓
Pixel extraction
↓
RGB channels
↓
LSB modification
↓
Embedded payload
↓
PNG output
```

Do not modify alpha.

Store metadata:

* Magic identifier
* Payload length
* Version

Validate image capacity.

If payload exceeds capacity:

Return:

`IMAGE_CAPACITY_EXCEEDED`

